<title>ZIMBABWE: TABLE - Zimbabwe July CPI rises 19.1 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Zimbabwe July CPI rises 19.1 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe's all-items consumer price index eased by 0.1 percent in July from June, bringing the year-on-year rate to 19.1 percent, the Central Statistical Office said.</p>
<p>				    July 1997   June 1997   July 1996</p>
<p>Year-on-year pct change	19.1	  21.4	  22.0</p>
<p>All-items index		 485.6	 486.2	 407.8</p>
<p>Food-only index		 633.4	 660.9	 542.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Index base 1990=100</p>
<p>-- Harare newsroom: +2634 72 52 27/8/9</p>
